---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — FinTrack"
  description="FinTrack Terms of Service — your rights and obligations when using our personal finance platform."
  canonicalPath="/terms"
  noindex={false}
>

<div style="padding-top:7rem;padding-bottom:6rem;background:var(--surface);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="badge badge-green" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Legal</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);">Last updated: June 13, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of the FinTrack platform and services. By creating an account or using FinTrack, you agree to these Terms.</p>

      <h2>1. Service Description</h2>
      <p>FinTrack is a personal finance management tool. We provide bank statement parsing, transaction categorization, budgeting tools, and financial analytics. FinTrack is not a bank, financial advisor, investment broker, or credit provider. We do not hold your funds or execute financial transactions on your behalf.</p>

      <h2>2. Eligibility</h2>
      <p>You must be at least 18 years old and legally capable of entering into a contract. By using FinTrack, you confirm you meet these requirements.</p>

      <h2>3. Account Responsibilities</h2>
      <p>You are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure. You must notify us immediately at security@fintrack.app if you suspect unauthorized access to your account.</p>

      <h2>4. Acceptable Use</h2>
      <p>You agree not to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Upload documents you do not have the right to share</li>
        <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer or scrape the FinTrack platform</li>
        <li>Use FinTrack for any illegal purpose or in violation of UAE law</li>
        <li>Share your account credentials with unauthorized parties</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Subscription & Billing</h2>
      <p>Free plans are provided at no charge. Premium plans are billed monthly or annually as selected. Subscriptions auto-renew unless cancelled before the next billing date. All prices are in USD unless otherwise stated. You can cancel at any time from Settings → Subscription.</p>

      <h2>6. Refund Policy</h2>
      <p>If you are not satisfied with Premium within your first 30 days, we will issue a full refund upon request to hello@fintrack.app. After 30 days, refunds are at our discretion.</p>

      <h2>7. Intellectual Property</h2>
      <p>FinTrack's software, design, and content are owned by FinTrack Inc. Your financial data remains yours at all times. We claim no ownership over transaction data you upload.</p>

      <h2>8. Disclaimers</h2>
      <p>FinTrack provides tools for personal finance management but makes no guarantee about the accuracy of categorization, Safe-to-Spend calculations, or any financial insight generated by the platform. Nothing in FinTrack constitutes financial advice. Always consult a qualified financial advisor for significant financial decisions.</p>

      <h2>9. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by UAE law, FinTrack's liability for any claim arising out of your use of the service is limited to the amount you paid us in the 3 months preceding the claim.</p>

      <h2>10. Governing Law</h2>
      <p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the United Arab Emirates. Any dispute will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Dubai, UAE.</p>

      <h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p>We'll notify you at least 14 days before any material change to these Terms. Continued use of FinTrack after the effective date constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.</p>

      <h2>12. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these Terms? Email <a href="mailto:legal@fintrack.app" style="color:var(--green-700);">legal@fintrack.app</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .875rem; color: var(--text-primary); padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .prose p  { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .prose ul { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .prose ul li { margin-bottom: .375rem; }
  .prose a  { color: var(--green-700); }
</style>
